\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3475645/001-8d1bffa41f.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3475645/001-8d1bffa41f.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"1126\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n这是什么情况啊！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n不得了（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3475645/002-00efaa585d.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3475645/002-00efaa585d.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"850\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n光是这个展板\n就已经够厉害了！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3475645/003-b0429a71c8.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3475645/003-b0429a71c8.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"848\"></a></figure> \n\n<br>\n\n\n宝可梦中心东北的3只宝可梦\n比克提尼\n皮卡丘\n哈力栗\n\n戴着\n可达鸭（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n然后……\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3475645/004-0db8a2cea7.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3475645/004-0db8a2cea7.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"621\" height=\"840\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n连书写用具都有！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n多么有创意啊！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n正这么想着……\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3475645/005-ff815dddc2.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3475645/005-ff815dddc2.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"720\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n这瓶水！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n太夸张了……\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n这份讲究……\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n太夸张了……\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3475645/006-0957d0fb25.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3475645/006-0957d0fb25.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"621\" height=\"840\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n仔细一看\n到处都是！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n太厉害了！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n宝可梦中心东北的\n各位工作人员\n真的非常感谢大家！\n\n<br>\n\n\n精彩的创意\n让我深受感动！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3475645/007-60926c5d9e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3475645/007-60926c5d9e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"848\"></a></figure>\n\n谢谢！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n下回再见！</div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">ポケモンセンタートウホクの</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">サイン会</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">まずは</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">控室へ</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3475645/001-8d1bffa41f.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3475645/001-8d1bffa41f.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"1126\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n何ということでしょう！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nエライコッチャ（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/imag